{"id":80655,"date":"2021-10-02T11:30:07","date_gmt":"2021-10-02T04:30:07","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/?p=80655"},"modified":"2021-10-02T11:30:07","modified_gmt":"2021-10-02T04:30:07","slug":"rapat-paripurna-pandangan-fraksi-dprd-jember-atas-usulan-lima-raperda","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/rapat-paripurna-pandangan-fraksi-dprd-jember-atas-usulan-lima-raperda\/","title":{"rendered":"Rapat Paripurna Pandangan Fraksi DPRD Jember Atas Usulan Lima Raperda"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-80670 size-full\" src=\"http:\/\/humas.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001152114_IMG_9572-scaled-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" \/><\/p>\n<p>JEMBER &#8211; Rapat Paripurna dengan agenda pandangan umum fraksi-fraksi terhadap nota pengantar Lima Rancangan Peraturan Daerah (Raperda) dilaksanakan di ruang sidang Paripurna DPRD Kabupaten Jember, Jumat (01\/10\/2021).<\/p>\n<p>Rapat paripurna ini dihadiri oleh Bupati Jember, Wabup Jember jajaran pimpinan DPRD, serta 18 orang anggota DPRD secara daring dan 17 orang anggota DPRD secara luring.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-80655 gallery-columns-4 gallery-size-full'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001151442_IMG_9546-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001151442_IMG_9546-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001151513_IMG_9549-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001151513_IMG_9549-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001151552_IMG_9551-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001151552_IMG_9551-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001151651_IMG_9553-scaled-e1633148935214.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1702\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001151651_IMG_9553-scaled-e1633148935214.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001151706_IMG_9554-scaled-e1633148957865.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1702\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001151706_IMG_9554-scaled-e1633148957865.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001152100_IMG_9571-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001152100_IMG_9571-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001152539_IMG_9575-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001152539_IMG_9575-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001153928_IMG_9602-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001153928_IMG_9602-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>Seluruh fraksi menyatakan dukungannya atas lima raperda dengan beberapa catatan-catatan.<\/p>\n<p>Fraksi Nasdem melalui juru bicara Hamim memberikan catatan untuk segera mencarikan solusi terhadap ketidakmampuan PDP Kahyangan dalam menghasilkan laba untuk meningkatkan PAD.<\/p>\n<p>&#8220;Harus segera ditemukan akar permasalahannya, ibarat penyakit harus segera dicari pemicunya dan segera diobati,&#8221; kata Hamim.<\/p>\n<p>Revitalisasi organisasi dalam perusahaan PDP Kahyangan juga harus segera diperbaiki, berikut konflik-konflik yang ditemukan untuk dapat segera diselesaikan dan dicari solusinya sehingga tidak menjadi berlarut-larut dan semakin parah.<\/p>\n<p>Sementara juru bicara Fraksi Gerakan Indonesia Berkarya (GIB) Alfian Andri Wijaya menyampaikan catatan untuk raperda PDP Kahyangan dan Perumdam Tirta Pandalungan, seyogyanya harus bisa berdiri sendiri dan mampu menghidupi karyawannya.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-2' class='gallery galleryid-80655 gallery-columns-4 gallery-size-full'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001151830_IMG_9558-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1707\" height=\"2560\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001151830_IMG_9558-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001151831_IMG_9559-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1707\" height=\"2560\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001151831_IMG_9559-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001151840_IMG_9562-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1707\" height=\"2560\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001151840_IMG_9562-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001152920_IMG_9581-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1707\" height=\"2560\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001152920_IMG_9581-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001153811_IMG_9596-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1707\" height=\"2560\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001153811_IMG_9596-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001154826_IMG_9620-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1707\" height=\"2560\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001154826_IMG_9620-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001155841_IMG_9640-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1707\" height=\"2560\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001155841_IMG_9640-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001163701_IMG_9661-scaled-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1707\" height=\"2560\" src=\"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001163701_IMG_9661-scaled-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>&#8220;Keduanya harus dapat dikelola dengan pengelolaan yang profesional, kami fraksi Gerindra berharap kedua perusahaan tersebut mampu berdiri sendiri, bukan lagi bergantung pada kucuran modal dari APBD dalam bentuk penyertaan modal,&#8221; kata Alfian.<\/p>\n<p>Untuk diketahui, Bupati Jember Ir. Hendy Siswanto mengajukan raperda di antaranya raperda tentang pertama Kabupaten layak anak, kedua Raperda perubahan atas Perda No. 3 tahun 2016 tentang pembentukan dan susunan perangkat daerah, ketiga Raperda tentang pengelolaan sampah, keempat Raperda tentang Perusahaan daerah perkebunan kahyangan Jember, kelima Raperda tentang Perumdam Tirta Pandalungan. (ipf)<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>JEMBER &#8211; Rapat Paripurna dengan agenda pandangan umum fraksi-fraksi terhadap nota pengantar Lima Rancangan Peraturan Daerah (Raperda) dilaksanakan di ruang sidang Paripurna DPRD Kabupaten Jember, Jumat (01\/10\/2021). Rapat paripurna ini dihadiri oleh Bupati Jember, Wabup Jember jajaran pimpinan DPRD, serta 18 orang anggota DPRD secara daring dan 17 orang anggota DPRD secara luring. Seluruh fraksi &hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":80670,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[3],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-80655","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-berita-terbaru"],"jetpack_featured_media_url":"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211001152114_IMG_9572-scaled-1.jpg","_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/80655","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=80655"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/80655\/revisions"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/80670"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/www.jemberkab.go.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=80655"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"ht